WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Akuma waits as Ryu rises from the blocked reversal.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.050
Heavy Adamant Flame punish-counters Ryu’s recovery.

3
00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:03.300
Crouching heavy punch links after the punish counter.

4
00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:04.200
OD Adamant Flame and its follow-up launch Ryu.

5
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.150
Akuma rushes forward after the launch.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.200
Light Gou Hadoken follows the Rush heavy punch.

7
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.900
Heavy Tatsu carries Ryu toward the corner.

8
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:08.300
Ryu recovers beside the corner at the end of the carry route.
